---
import InfoPageLayout from '../layouts/InfoPageLayout.astro';
---
<InfoPageLayout
  eyebrow="Corrections, feedback & partnerships"
  title="Contact HydroRigor"
  description="The planned contact architecture for corrections, reader feedback, source updates, and partnership inquiries."
  pathname="/contact/"
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Editorial Policy', href: '/editorial-policy/' },
    { label: 'About HydroRigor', href: '/about/' },
    { label: 'Search HydroRigor', href: '/search/' },
  ]}
>
  <aside class="rounded-xl border border-amber-measure/30 bg-mineral-sand p-5">
    <strong class="font-heading text-hydro-deep">Contact is not active yet</strong>
    <p class="mt-2">No email address, form backend, or third-party contact service has been authorized. A working contact channel will be activated and tested before production publishing.</p>
  </aside>

  <h2>Correction requests</h2>
  <p>The future correction path will ask for the page URL, the statement in question, the proposed correction, and a supporting source where available. Reports will be evaluated against the editorial policy.</p>

  <h2>Reader feedback</h2>
  <p>Feedback about navigation, clarity, accessibility, missing context, or useful future topics will have a dedicated route once contact functionality is authorized.</p>

  <h2>Source and product updates</h2>
  <p>Publishers and manufacturers will be able to flag changed specifications or documentation. A submitted update will be treated as a lead for verification, not as automatically accepted evidence.</p>

  <h2>Partnership inquiries</h2>
  <p>Future partnership messages will be separated from editorial corrections. Any material relationship relevant to published content must be disclosed under the affiliate and editorial policies.</p>
</InfoPageLayout>
